sequenceDiagram
    participant Frontend
    participant BackendSDK as Backend E2EE SDK
    participant KeyStore as Redis SessionKeyStore

    Frontend->>Frontend: Sinh client ECDH key pair và clientNonce
    Frontend->>BackendSDK: clientPubJwk, clientNonce

    BackendSDK->>BackendSDK: Sinh server ECDH key pair và serverNonce
    BackendSDK->>BackendSDK: ECDH + HKDF-SHA256 tạo sessionKey
    BackendSDK->>KeyStore: Lưu sessionId -> sessionKey TTL 30 phút
    BackendSDK->>BackendSDK: Ký sessionId + serverNonce + serverPubJwk bằng ECDSA

    BackendSDK-->>Frontend: sessionId, serverPubJwk, serverNonce, chữ ký
    Frontend->>Frontend: Xác minh chữ ký ECDSA
    Frontend->>Frontend: ECDH + HKDF-SHA256 tạo sessionKey
    Frontend->>Frontend: Lưu session trong runtime memory